        "sourceName": "吴都候选：今苏州古城（虚线参照）",
        "enName": "Wu capital candidate: present Suzhou old city (dashed reference)",
        "enSourceName": "Wu capital candidate: present Suzhou old city (dashed reference)",
        "label": "今苏州古城候选框\n阖闾城位置存在争议",
        "enLabel": "Suzhou old-city candidate\nHelü capital location disputed",
        "referenceUrl": "https://dfzb.suzhou.gov.cn/dfzb/fzxh/201107/2670e6a6682149a0b0777b63d30eecf3.shtml",
        "status": "传统地望说 · 虚线候选框，非春秋城界",
        "enStatus": "Traditional location hypothesis; dashed candidate outline, not Spring and Autumn walls",
        "labelCoordinates": [
          120.621,
          31.281
        ],
        "wuCapitalCandidate": "traditional-city",
        "note": "为比较“今苏州古城为阖闾城”的传统地望说，复用项目已有BIAM明清苏州古城外轮廓作现代古城位置参照，以空心虚线候选框表达。不是把明清城墙年代改为春秋，也不是声称已发掘同形同规模的吴国城墙。苏州地方志明确列出今苏州城、木渎及无锡—常州等不同地望观点。本轮重点比较木渎—胥口与今苏州古城两处；这不表示争议仅有两种方案。原明清城郭、元代盘门、宋元子城及全部现存遗迹保持各自分期。阖闾城位置存在争议。",
        "enNote": "A hollow dashed comparison outline for the traditional hypothesis identifying Helü’s capital with today’s Suzhou old city. Reuses the existing BIAM Ming–Qing circuit only as a locator for the present historic core. It does not redate those walls or claim a matching excavated Spring and Autumn circuit. Other proposed locations include the Wuxi–Changzhou site; the two displayed candidates are not an exhaustive list. Existing Yuan, Song and Ming–Qing remains retain their own chronology. Helü’s capital location is disputed."
      },
